IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ATM.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 BALANCE PIC 9(7).
01 AMOUNT PIC 9(7).
01 ACC-STATUS PIC X.
01 ATM-STATUS PIC X.
01 REMAINING PIC 9(7).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "ENTER BALANCE:"
    ACCEPT BALANCE

    DISPLAY "ENTER WITHDRAWAL AMOUNT:"
    ACCEPT AMOUNT

    DISPLAY "ACCOUNT STATUS (A/I):"
    ACCEPT ACC-STATUS

    DISPLAY "ATM AVAILABLE (Y/N):"
    ACCEPT ATM-STATUS

    IF ACC-STATUS NOT = 'A'
        DISPLAY "ACCOUNT INACTIVE"
    ELSE
        IF ATM-STATUS NOT = 'Y'
            DISPLAY "ATM NOT AVAILABLE"
        ELSE
            IF AMOUNT = 0
                DISPLAY "INVALID AMOUNT"
            ELSE
                IF AMOUNT > BALANCE
                    DISPLAY "INSUFFICIENT BALANCE"
                ELSE
                    COMPUTE REMAINING =
                        BALANCE - AMOUNT
                    DISPLAY "SUCCESS"
                    DISPLAY "BALANCE: " REMAINING
                END-IF
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
